How many times is the statement `count++` executed when the fragment below runs with $n = 16$?

```c
int count = 0;
for (int i = 1; i <= n; i = i * 2)
    for (int j = 1; j <= i; j++)
        count++;
```

What is the time complexity of the following fragment as a function of $n$?

```c
for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++)
    for (int j = 1; j <= n; j += i)
        x = x + 1;
```

Consider the function below. How many calls to `fib` are made in total (including the first call) when evaluating `fib(6)`?

```c
int fib(int n) {
    if (n < 2) return n;
    return fib(n - 1) + fib(n - 2);
}
```
